  <ColorBox Color="#f6ee9c" Margin="1"><Box Margin="3">Tier 3 — Utility</Box></ColorBox>
  <ColorBox Color="#f1cba8" Margin="1"><Box Margin="3">Tier 4 — Impactful</Box></ColorBox>
  <ColorBox Color="#f6c3d6" Margin="1"><Box Margin="3">Tier 5 — Highly Impactful</Box></ColorBox>
</Table>
- [color=#c9caec]Lavender[/color] basics have no known mutation.
- [color=#57c84d]Bright green[/color] crops are gimmick plants that grow from special seeds.
- [color=#f5a623]Orange[/color] crops are illegal or highly dangerous.

